  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for systemd",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for systemd fixes the following issue:\n\nSecurity issue fixed:\n\n- CVE-2026-16742: `systemd-homed`: local privilege escalation due to missing home record signature verification on\n  the authentication path (bsc#1271444).\n\nNon security issue fixed:\n\n- `systemd-resolved` fails to start due to write access to `tmpfs` denied (bsc#1237515).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
